The [[Critwood Staff]] is a [[Ranger]] [[Weapon]] normally obtained by combining a [[Magic Staff]] with an [[Acorn Collar]]. Like all [[Staff|staves]], it spends {{icon/mana}} to cause a powerful effect, which in this case, is to cause all the player's attacks to critical hit for a short time. The effect lasts about 2/3 of the cooldown period, meaning about 2/3s of the time can be spent in this critical state, as long as enough {{icon/mana}} is supplied. This could be brought to nearly 100% of the time by using methods for speeding up items or by lengthening item duration with something like [[Time Melting]].

While the [[Critwood Staff]] can be expected to do moderate-to-high damage on its own when supplied with {{icon/mana}}, combining it with other [[weapon]]s can drastically raise the damage output. Unlike many other staves, the [[Critwood Staff]] does not somehow permanently gain damage the more it's used, meaning it doesn't inherently ramp up as the fight goes on, and is equally powerful at all times.
